<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A+ to Anheuser-Busch's dual samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A+ to Anheuser-Busch's dual samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Thursday it had assigned an A+ rating to Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc's 30 billion yen worth of yen/A$ dual-currency samurai bonds due December 1999.</p>
<p>S&amp;P also affirmed its AA- rating for the existing debt of Anheuser-Busch.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating reflects Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc's leading market position in the the U.S. beer industry, strong cash flows, and moderate financial policies,&quot; S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
